    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "REA Stokes and Quirke are delighted to bring to the market this superbly located 3 bedroom house, ideally situated just off the Cashel Road withing walking distance to the town centre. \r\nThe house is presented in good decorative order throughout and is ready for immediate occupation. It provides spacious accommodation with the benefit of a floored attic space with ensuite bathroom. It has a mature garden to front and rear with a range of useful outbuildings. Early viewing is recommended. \r\n \r\n\r\nAccommodation\r\n\r\nHallway\r\n1.93m x 3.12m Solid timber flooring, exposed timber staircase, door to,\r\n\r\nLiving Room\r\n4.00m x 3.40m Timber floor, timer surround fireplace, large window facing front garden, open plan to,\r\n\r\nSitting Room\r\n3.60m x 4.70m Timber floor with bay window overlooking spacious and bright beautifully landscaped rear garden with large patio area and range of outbuildings. Door to,\r\n\r\nDining Room\r\n2.40m x 3.70m Laminate flooring, French doors to rear garden and patio area, open plan to kitchen area\r\n\r\nKitchen\r\n2.40m x 5.60m Built in units at eye and floor level, plumbed for dishwasher electric oven with extractor. Door to back garden and door to laundry room.\r\n\r\nLaundry Room\r\n2.40m x 3.60m Laminate floor, built in units at eye and floor level. Door to front garden\r\n\r\nLanding\r\n Carpeted staircase and landing\r\n\r\nFirst Floor\r\n Hotpress on landing\r\n\r\nBedroom 1\r\n4.20m x 3.90m Facing front, built in wardrobes\r\n\r\nBedroom 2\r\n4.20m x 3.40m Facing rear, built in wardrobes\r\n\r\nBathroom\r\n2.30m x 1.67m Wall to ceiling tiled with electric power shower, heated towel rail, WC, whb\r\n\r\nBedroom 3\r\n2.70m x 2.80m Facing front, built in wardrobes\r\n\r\nAttic Room 1\r\n3.15m x 5.10m Large floored attic with built in storage cupboards and ensuite thereoff,\r\n\r\nEn-suite\r\n2.40m x 0.87m Wc, whb, electric shower\r\n\r\n\r\nOutside\r\nGarden and patio area to rear outbuildings"
      },
